{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-04-01 00:07:00', 'title': 'CELONIS, IBM AND RED HAT FORM STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO HELP TRANSFORM BUSINESS EXECUTION', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MUNICH, ARMONK, N.Y. AND\xa0RALEIGH, N.C, APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CELONIS, IBM (NYSE: IBM)\xa0AND RED HAT TODAY ANNOUNCED A GLOBAL STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO HELP ACCELERATE THE ADOPTION OF THE CELONIS EXECUTION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (EMS) AND HELP DELIVER MORE FLEXIBILITY AND CHOICE IN HOW CUSTOMERS DEPLOY THE TECHNOLOGY.'}